sequenceDiagram
    actor Author
    participant UI
    participant API as Edge API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AI as Gemini
    Author->>UI: Submit or recheck
    UI->>API: Revision and idempotency key
    API->>DB: Validate actor and atomically claim review lease
    DB-->>API: Immutable revision snapshot and lease token
    API->>API: Apply deterministic checklist
    API->>AI: Bounded text and JSON schema
    AI-->>API: Structured findings
    API->>API: Validate shape evidence and field paths
    API->>DB: Finalize only matching lease revision and hash
    alt Current revision still matches
        DB-->>API: Needs clarification or ready for approval
        API-->>UI: Current result
    else Author edited during review
        DB-->>API: Historical result only
        API-->>UI: Request changed recheck latest revision
    end
